[5.178,"o","\r\n============================================================\r\n   SAIL-PROXY Kyma Setup\r\n============================================================\r\n\r\nThis script will help you configure the SAP LLM Gateway\r\nfor Kyma deployment, including:\r\n  - Kubernetes manifests and ConfigMaps\r\n  - Authentication providers\r\n  - Public HTTPS or internal-only deployment\r\n  - IP allowlisting with Istio AuthorizationPolicy\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mKubernetes namespace to deploy into:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(sail-proxy-test) \u001b[22m\u001b[57D\u001b[57C\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mKubernetes namespace to deploy into:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36msail-proxy-test\u001b[39m\u001b[54D\u001b[54C\r\nKubernetes namespace: sail-proxy-test (not the default sail-proxy)\r\n   Output: kyma/deployments/sail-proxy-test\r\n   istio-system and cluster-scoped objects are prefixed \"sail-proxy-test-\"\r\n\r\n"]
[5.644,"o","🔑 Namespace sail-proxy-test does not exist yet on kube context kyma-demo (https://sail.example.com)\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mIs this the right cluster? Generate new encryption keys and database credentials for namespace \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1msail-proxy-test?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(y/N) \u001b[22m\u001b[23D\u001b[10C\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mIs this the right cluster? Generate new encryption keys and database credentials for namespace \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1msail-proxy-test?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(y/N) \u001b[22my\u001b[24D\u001b[11C"]
[5.748,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mIs this the right cluster? Generate new encryption keys and database credentials for namespace \u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[1msail-proxy-test?\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mYes\u001b[39m\u001b[20D\u001b[7C\r\n   Generating new encryption keys for namespace sail-proxy-test\r\n\r\nDeployment Options:\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect deployment type:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Public HTTPS - Internet accessible with IP allowlisting\u001b[39m \r\n  Internal-only - Access via Cloud Connector Service Channel \u001b[61D\u001b[61C"]
[5.832,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect deployment type:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mPublic HTTPS\u001b[39m\u001b[38D\u001b[38C\r\n\u001b[?25hAvailable authentication providers:\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect authentication provider:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(Use arrow keys)\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[36m❯ Local Development (hardcoded users) - ⚠️  WARNING: Do not use in production!\u001b[39m \r\n  GitHub OAuth \r\n  LDAP/Active Directory \r\n  Okta SAML \u001b[12D\u001b[12C"]
[5.916,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[1A\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mSelect authentication provider:\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mLocal Development (hardcoded users)\u001b[39m\u001b[69D\u001b[69C\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\nConfiguring Local Development (hardcoded users)...\r\n\r\n\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mLogout redirect URL\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m(auto-shell) \u001b[22m\u001b[35D\u001b[35C"]
[6.001,"o","\u001b[2K\u001b[G\u001b[32m?\u001b[39m \u001b[1mLogout redirect URL\u001b[22m\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[36mauto-shell\u001b[39m\u001b[32D\u001b[32C\r\n\r\nPublic HTTPS Configuration:\r\n"]
